/T (Beyond defence projects, our expertise extends to structural fabrications and civil work being done at our facility. The FSI Cradle Fabrication and related civil works are progressing efficiently, with 56% of the work completed. With every successful ship repairs, and every groundbreaking achievement, Sea Blue Shipyard Ltd is solidifying its position as a leader in ship repair and maintenance, ensuring that every vessel entrusted to us sails forward with strength and reliability.)
