269 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (At Sea Blue Shipyard Ltd, our production team is operating at peak efficiency, with the shipyard bustling with defence vessels undergoing crucial repairs and maintenance. Our dedication to excellence drives us to push boundaries every day, setting new standards in ship repair and engineering. One of our most groundbreaking achievements has been the successful balloon docking of FB Prathayak, a first in the history of the Indian Navy and the nation. This innovative docking method, which uses inflatable balloons to lift and position the vessel, represents a significant leap forward in efficiency, safety, and precision in ship maintenance. The approval from the Indian Navy for this docking technique is a testament to our shipyard's technical expertise, innovation, and ability to handle complex projects. This milestone not only enhances our reputation as a leader in ship repair but also paves the way for advanced docking solutions in India's maritime industry.)
/E (At Sea Blue Shipyard Ltd, our production team is operating at peak efficiency, with the shipyard bustling with defence vessels undergoing crucial repairs and maintenance. Our dedication to excellence drives us to push boundaries every day, setting new standards in ship repair and engineering. One of our most groundbreaking achievements has been the successful balloon docking of FB Prathayak, a first in the history of the Indian Navy and the nation. This innovative docking method, which uses inflatable balloons to lift and position the vessel, represents a significant leap forward in efficiency, safety, and precision in ship maintenance. The approval from the Indian Navy for this docking technique is a testament to our shipyard's technical expertise, innovation, and ability to handle complex projects. This milestone not only enhances our reputation as a leader in ship repair but also paves the way for advanced docking solutions in India's maritime industry.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
