/T (Our Campus Connect Programs bridge the gap between students, alumni, and the community, offering networking, mentorship, and skill-building opportunities. We partner with Engineering Colleges forIndustrial Visits and Internships, allowing students to learn about Shipbuilding and refit. They also engage with experienced engineers, gaining insights into Shipyard Operations. Additionally, we foster a sustainable talent pipeline by collaborating with local welding institutions to provide opportunities for skilled workers.)
